ucer  yasuhiro katau sub playtime will vary  depending on a number of factors but the  main route should take players around 30  hours as for the day one patch from  software didn't announce specifics about  what's included apart from that the  updates and optimizations are based on  the feedback from the network test and  that's not the only feedback that from  software has been acting on as all  online servers for the dark souls series  on pc have been taken offline due to an  exploit that can give an attacker access  to your entire system a dark souls 3  streamer by the name of the grim sleeper  streamed the exploit and took over his  own pc using a narration app to read out  some text to prove how easy it was to  control the system remotely this past  sunday it seems from software noticed  with a tweet indicating that all pvp  servers for the entirety of the dark  souls series would be taken offline on  pc as it investigates the exploit is  quite severe but it seems that the small  community that knows how to exploit it  hasn't chosen to do anything serious  with it and initially chose to report it  for fixing it's especially important  that it's getting fixed now too given  that the exploit was found in some data  mine code for ldin ring which is set to  launch next month  and for all the dead by day lightheads  out there the newest crossover event has  just been announced the horror game is  once again crossing over with the spooky  movie series saw with the villainous  killer jigsaw coming to the game  starting january 26th players will dig  into the memories of amanda young and  detective tap the expansion will also  add outfits for young and tap in  addition to 60 new cosmetic items the  saw content is being released in  partnership between developer behavior  interactive and movie studio lionsgate  this is just the latest saw crossover in  dead by daylight though as the first  took place back in 2018.  if you played the first saw crossover  for dead by day